{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56528","headline":"菩萨蛮 · 陶埴","name":"菩萨蛮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家家尽有长生药，时人取用皆差错。\n气候若飞沈，问君何处寻？\n眼看犹不识，误向铅中觅。\n此物没黄芽，徒劳岁月赊。\n（以上二首均见《金液还丹百问诀》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶埴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}